- `std::thread`: Creating and managing threads;
- `std::mutex` : Protecting shared state;
- `std::lock_guard` / `std::unique_lock`: Managing locks with RAII;
- `std::atomic` : Performing atomic operations on individual objects;
- `std::condition_variable` : Making threads wait for a condition to occur;
- `std::future` / `std::promise`: Passing future results between threads or tasks;
- `std::jthread` / `std::stop_token`: More modern thread lifecycle and stop requests\.
